/* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   Course 6 · Knowing God
   Twelve weeks slowly through God's revealed character.

   Prerequisites: Foundations, Story of God, Disciplines, Sermon on
   the Mount, Making Disciples. After the believer has been formed
   inward and turned outward, this course returns them to the
   deepest possible question — Who is the God they know? — and
   answers it attribute by attribute. Loosely inspired by J.I.
   Packer's classic Knowing God, but written fresh.
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */

