      "Practically, for the close of this course: pick the one attribute that most needs to be alive in your daily walk in the coming year. Make it your meditation. Read books on it. Pray it back. Write it in your journal. Tell others what God is teaching you about it. Watch what one year of focused beholding does to a soul. The glory is real. The transformation is real. The face is waiting. Come, Lord Jesus.",
